-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §52 תקציב לציוד לחדרי מורים: from 1.1.2011
-- the yearly budget transferred to the organisation to buy equipment for
-- teachers' rooms grows to 2.5 million shekels.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`

§ `52 תקציב לציוד לחדרי מורים`

-- ¶1: from 1.1.2011 the yearly budget transferred to the organisation for
-- buying equipment for teachers' rooms is raised to 2.5 million. Years are
-- calendar years; before 2011 the budget is what it was, which is not this
-- agreement's. "המועבר" names no one to transfer it, and the sentence
-- raises an existing budget rather than making a duty, so none is written.
@ref akn:art_52/p1
`the teachers' rooms budget section 52 sets` MEANS 2_500_000

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER @desc a calendar year
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the yearly teachers' rooms budget under section 52 for` y IS
    IF y AT LEAST 2011
    THEN JUST `the teachers' rooms budget section 52 sets`
    ELSE NOTHING

`why the teachers' rooms budget before 2011 is not here` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "התקציב השנתי המועבר לארגון המורים לרכישת ציוד לחדרי מורים, ערב 1.1.2011"

#ASSERT `the yearly teachers' rooms budget under section 52 for` 2011 EQUALS JUST 2_500_000
#ASSERT `the yearly teachers' rooms budget under section 52 for` 2010 EQUALS NOTHING
